# TripForge Frontend — Environment Variables
#
# ── Docker mode (default) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# When running via docker compose, VITE_API_BASE_URL is set to "" (empty).
# The browser uses relative /api/* paths which nginx proxies to api-gateway:8080.
# You do NOT need to set this variable for Docker usage.
#
# ── Local dev mode (npm run dev) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# When running the Vite dev server directly (outside Docker), set this to
# the API gateway address so the dev server can reach the backend:
#
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
